            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-painter-chemotactic-stripe-splitting-measurement-simulated-1d-keller-segel-chemotactic-stripe-wavelength-vs-analytical-lambda-c>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-painter-chemotactic-stripe-splitting-measurement-slime-trail-shifted-chemotactic-threshold-chi-c-m-predicted-by-law-6-vs-simulated-onset-bracket>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-painter-chemotactic-stripe-splitting-measurement-supercritical-chi-6-0-vs-subcritical-negative-control-chi-3-0-chi-c-stripe-peak-delta>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-painter-chemotactic-stripe-splitting-measurement-trail-sustained-rippling-ridge-amplitude-ratio-a-1-6-vs-isotropic-a-0-at-chi-4-4-chi-c>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-painter-chemotactic-stripe-splitting-morphometric-validation-1> ;
